{"docstore/ref_doc_info": {"421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237": {"node_ids": ["fbcfb5ba-bccc-41f3-a48c-f0871d644a12", "f8ed4118-d92c-497d-9916-4acb6845cdcf", "7ab2992c-7989-4ac9-8ff6-459e710b1eec", "e8119a71-9f32-454c-9a17-7324fa80d70a", "172355bf-51d8-4627-8df2-f178ace0d2ac"], "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}}}, "docstore/data": {"fbcfb5ba-bccc-41f3-a48c-f0871d644a12": {"__data__": {"id_": "fbcfb5ba-bccc-41f3-a48c-f0871d644a12", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "hash": "57cbc1943f2bd5ddeb7aa3d32a200aa3918be6652c8c016aca4176fd80b5e131", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "f8ed4118-d92c-497d-9916-4acb6845cdcf", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "fabd3ce470310da295f0aa170e1b663c6e8663c0127511b0e98c27fcd674ffa9", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Broker FAQ \u2013 Made-up version for testing purposes only\n\n\n\n1. What commission structure applies to this product?\n\nWe operate a transparent commission model. Commission is earned on the base premium only and is detailed within your broker agreement. Commission percentages vary depending on distribution channel, expected volume, and historical loss performance. Commission statements are produced monthly to support your internal reconciliation processes.\n\n\n\n2. How is commission paid?\n\nCommission is applied at new business, renewal, and mid-term adjustment stages. Payments are remitted monthly by BACS. A full itemised statement is available in the broker portal.\n\n\n\n3. Can commission percentages be negotiated?\n\nYes. Requests should be submitted to your Broker Development Manager. Adjustments may be approved based on volume, claims performance, and service delivery.\n\n\n\n4. Who do I contact for additional product briefings or training?\n\nBroker Training & Development Team\n\nEmail: training@example-insurer.com\n\nPhone: 0800 441 992\n\nWhatsApp: +44 7111 802 555\n\n\n\n5. Does this product support premium finance?\n\nNo. Premium finance is not available. Clients may pay either monthly via direct debit or annually via bank transfer or card.\n\n\n\n6. How does invoicing work for brokers?\n\nYou will receive an independent invoice per policy. You may submit a combined broker remittance covering multiple invoices if preferred.\n\n\n\n7. What documentation must be provided at inception?\n\nAccurate proposal details, risk narratives, occupancy confirmation, security declarations, and evidence for specified items.\n\n\n\n", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 1604, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "f8ed4118-d92c-497d-9916-4acb6845cdcf": {"__data__": {"id_": "f8ed4118-d92c-497d-9916-4acb6845cdcf", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "hash": "57cbc1943f2bd5ddeb7aa3d32a200aa3918be6652c8c016aca4176fd80b5e131", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "fbcfb5ba-bccc-41f3-a48c-f0871d644a12", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "hash": "7f600bdf68f54a2bf4d537fefb192f6dee0cb7f4ac183478a3d242d80b058c08", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "7ab2992c-7989-4ac9-8ff6-459e710b1eec", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "4bd43bb9c0a0c6234769e08295f77b22c985f11cec14bc8b0e9363353d8c4451", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "8. Available Limits Table:\n\nGeneral Contents: $1,000 / $5,000 / $10,000\n\nOutbuilding Contents: $1,000 / $5,000 / $10,000\n\nHigh-Value Items: Up to $10,000 per item\n\nPersonal Possessions: $1,000 / $5,000\n\nFreezer Contents: $1,000 / $5,000 / $10,000\n\nWould you like me to confirm the specific inclusion from your Policy Terms and Conditions?\n\n\n\n9. ", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 1604, "end_char_idx": 1949, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "7ab2992c-7989-4ac9-8ff6-459e710b1eec": {"__data__": {"id_": "7ab2992c-7989-4ac9-8ff6-459e710b1eec", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "hash": "57cbc1943f2bd5ddeb7aa3d32a200aa3918be6652c8c016aca4176fd80b5e131", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "f8ed4118-d92c-497d-9916-4acb6845cdcf", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "hash": "39b4f9911aeca8e98469ca052a761b5d3d9979cfce030168babb58528b2181ce", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "e8119a71-9f32-454c-9a17-7324fa80d70a", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "b52273be57a3f526946ccddb601c687495ea6dcea1e474d46e1c3f4a8feb2b10", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "How do brokers request MTAs?\n\nSubmit via the broker portal. Underwriting review may be triggered depending on the change.\n\n\n\n10. What is the referral process?\n\nReferrals go to a commercial underwriter with same-day turnaround for standard risks.\n\n\n\n11. Is subsidence covered?\n\nSubsidence is only covered when explicitly stated in the Policy Terms and Conditions.\n\n\n\n12. How should Japanese Knotweed risks be handled?\n\nCover only applies where explicitly included in the policy wording.\n\n\n\n13. What about specialist equipment?\n\nHigh-value or specialist equipment may need valuation or itemisation.\n\n\n\n14. Do brokers have authority to bind cover?\n\nOnly where stated in your Delegated Authority agreement.\n\n\n\n15. How do brokers support claims submissions?\n\nClaims can be submitted at www.example-insurer.com/claims\n\n\n\n16. Do brokers receive claims updates?\n\nYes. Updates are issued at key stages.\n\n\n\n", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 1949, "end_char_idx": 2846, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "e8119a71-9f32-454c-9a17-7324fa80d70a": {"__data__": {"id_": "e8119a71-9f32-454c-9a17-7324fa80d70a", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "hash": "57cbc1943f2bd5ddeb7aa3d32a200aa3918be6652c8c016aca4176fd80b5e131", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "7ab2992c-7989-4ac9-8ff6-459e710b1eec", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "hash": "6adc522b40b5613db0fd8f4427b81f1a14ab0e080f8ed89c8aa582ca98fcf7ff", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "3": {"node_id": "172355bf-51d8-4627-8df2-f178ace0d2ac", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {}, "hash": "2c94d3df3fb5d2e67f0c4845e8a04a7c394435540e3393ad6f92c4069ddcd94b", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "17. Summary of Policy Terms:\n\nIncludes cover for contents, outbuildings, personal possessions, specified items, escape of water, fire, theft, malicious damage, freezer contents, and storm damage.\n\nExcludes wear and tear, gradual deterioration, subsidence unless included, Japanese Knotweed unless included, business-use items, and prolonged unoccupancy.\n\n\n\n18. ", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 2846, "end_char_idx": 3207, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "172355bf-51d8-4627-8df2-f178ace0d2ac": {"__data__": {"id_": "172355bf-51d8-4627-8df2-f178ace0d2ac", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "hash": "57cbc1943f2bd5ddeb7aa3d32a200aa3918be6652c8c016aca4176fd80b5e131", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}, "2": {"node_id": "e8119a71-9f32-454c-9a17-7324fa80d70a", "node_type": "1", "metadata": {"file_name": "Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_path": "data\\uploads\\Broker_FAQ_doc.docx", "file_type": "application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document", "file_size": 35451, "creation_date": "2026-07-22", "last_modified_date": "2026-07-22"}, "hash": "ed9e727a3efaf3abae6a0e705129f3739a9e34e59e6580e2bad89093b163a22d", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "What service levels can brokers expect?\n\nNew business referral: same day\n\nMTAs: 24 hours\n\nClaims acknowledgment: 4 hours\n\nDocumentation: 24 hours\n\n\n\n19. Who should brokers contact for general support?\n\nBroker Support Line: 0800 442 881\n\nWhatsApp: +44 7111 800 992\n\nEmail: brokersupport@example-insurer.com\n\nWe look forward to hearing from you.\n\n\n\n20. Is product training included?\n\nYes. Digital guides, underwriting workshops, sales sessions, and annual refresh sessions are available.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 3207, "end_char_idx": 3692, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}}, "docstore/metadata": {"fbcfb5ba-bccc-41f3-a48c-f0871d644a12": {"doc_hash": "7f600bdf68f54a2bf4d537fefb192f6dee0cb7f4ac183478a3d242d80b058c08", "ref_doc_id": "421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237"}, "f8ed4118-d92c-497d-9916-4acb6845cdcf": {"doc_hash": "39b4f9911aeca8e98469ca052a761b5d3d9979cfce030168babb58528b2181ce", "ref_doc_id": "421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237"}, "7ab2992c-7989-4ac9-8ff6-459e710b1eec": {"doc_hash": "6adc522b40b5613db0fd8f4427b81f1a14ab0e080f8ed89c8aa582ca98fcf7ff", "ref_doc_id": "421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237"}, "e8119a71-9f32-454c-9a17-7324fa80d70a": {"doc_hash": "ed9e727a3efaf3abae6a0e705129f3739a9e34e59e6580e2bad89093b163a22d", "ref_doc_id": "421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237"}, "172355bf-51d8-4627-8df2-f178ace0d2ac": {"doc_hash": "4bce9241def96899e7fa86320b3e4bf9558e8374f06417c25bb2fd4ec2f99057", "ref_doc_id": "421034f1-2995-4f35-8937-be728c16f237"}}}